  "steps": [
    "Fry the tomatoes and shallots in the oil over medium-low heat with a big pinch of salt for 5 minutes to draw out moisture.",
    "Add the garlic, pepper, honey and balsamic on top and simmer 5 minutes without stirring.",
    "Turn off the heat, lay basil leaves over and cover with the puff pastry. Prick it, tuck in the sides and bake at 190 °C for 25 minutes.",
    "Rest 5 minutes, then turn out onto a plate. Finish with basil, feta and balsamic glaze."
